Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:40.20,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Çfarë?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:43.14,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Edhe hoteli është plot me libra!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:47.00,Default,Sachi,0,0,0,,Tokyo është e mahnitshme.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.13,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Oh, ajo vdiq.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:51.98,Default,Sachi,0,0,0,,Natën e mirë, Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:52.79,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Natën.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:53.51,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Dreq.
