Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:38.05,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Kaq shumë librari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:41.94,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Por nuk e gjej librin e Sensei-t askund.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.38,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Ai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:46.06,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Gjeta një dyqan të madh materialesh arti,\Ndhe është i mahnitshëm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.98,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Shisnin gjithfarë ngjyrash\Nqë nuk i kisha parë kurrë.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:57.31,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Gjeta gjithashtu\Nmangën e Teshima-sensei në shitje.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.95,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Çfarë?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:03.89,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Jam mjaft e sigurt se ishte nga kjo anë.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:08.79,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Ky vend...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:14.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(925,0)\bord0.2\b1\fnGeorgia\fs24\xshad2\frz10.2\fax-0.2\fay-0.035\1c&HE6EDE8&\3c&H6B6872&\4c&H000000&\pos(322,192)}Shogakukan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:14.30,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Është kompania\Nqë botoi librin e Sensei-t.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:20.86,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Kaq shumë libra krijohen pikërisht këtu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:21.69,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:26.67,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Jam mjaft e sigurt se libri i Sensei-t\Nishte atje.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:33.59,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Ashtu është.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.59,0:12:34.31,Default,Man B,0,0,0,,Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:35.74,Default,Man B,0,0,0,,Oh, e ke lexuar atë?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:37.77,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Po. Dëgjova se po ribotohet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.28,Default,Man B,0,0,0,,Kjo është mjaft e mahnitshme.
