Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.42,Flashback Italics,Ai,0,0,0,,Uau, sa shtrenjtë!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.36,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Jo se mund ta përballoja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.11,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\an8\fs14\fscx90\fax0.98\fay0.02\blur0.2\bord0\shad0\c&H0A1C39&\pos(264,186)}Momo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:27.77,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Ky libër është ribotuar kaq shumë herë.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.20,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\b1\fscx85\shad0\c&H1B3B46&\fs15\frz13.33\pos(524,112)}Botimi i parë\Ni shtypur
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.20,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\b1\fscx85\c&H1B3B46&\fs15\an8\frz13.33\pos(530,122)}Botimi i 80-të\Ni shtypur
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:31.70,Default,Kokoro,0,0,0,,Të shesësh një libër komercialisht\Nështë një arritje e pabesueshme, apo jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:35.15,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Duhet të shtypin librin e Sensei-t\Npo aq herë.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:39.43,Default,Rei,0,0,0,,Comitia fillon nesër,\Nndaj flini herët.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.09,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Në rregull!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.18,Italics,Ai\Italic,0,0,0,,Ndoshta një ditë, ai do të jetë libri ynë.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.11,Italics,Ai\Italic,0,0,0,,Sikur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:58.60,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1250,0)\bord2\fnVerdana\shad0\bord2.5\b1\fs50\pos(312,85)\3c&H93EBE6&}Manga Taisho
