Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:30.38,Default,Ai,0,0,0,,Zgjati vetëm një orë.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:32.57,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Punë e mirë.
